==Trivia==
This card is almost identical to {{TCG ID|Prismatic Evolutions|Spritzee|38}} from the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]'s {{TCG|Prismatic Evolutions}} expansion, except for the {{TCG|Weakness}} modifier.
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unbroken Bonds|Spritzee|141}} from the {{TCG|Unbroken Bonds}} expansion; both cards have the Fairy Wind attack.
*{{m|Fairy Wind}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Spritzee}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

